          <a href="#softness-myth" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">1. Why the Softest Deck Is Not the Kindest</a>
          <a href="#incline" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. Incline Is the Real Tool Here</a>
