          <a href="#how-we-tested" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. How We Measured Cushioning</a>
          <a href="#picks" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. The Six Best Treadmills for Bad Knees</a>
